"""
BMI Calculator - Oasis Infobyte Internship (Python Programming Domain)
========================================================================

A complete, production-ready BMI (Body Mass Index) Calculator desktop
application built with Tkinter, backed by an SQLite database for
persistent history, and matplotlib for trend visualization.

Author : Amani Kapil
Project: OIBsIP - Python Programming - Task 2 - BMI Calculator

Features:
    - Modern themed GUI (ttk) with a blue/white professional palette
